<title>FRANCE: EU taxes daily channel for wheat, durum, products.</title>
<headline>EU taxes daily channel for wheat, durum, products.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals management committee decided in Brussels on Thursday to impose taxes on wheat and durum and their products through its daily export channel, French cereals authority ONIC confirmed.</p>
<p>The taxes are effective August 1 for the following levels.</p>
<p>    Soft wheat grain     0.5 Ecus per tonne</p>
<p>    Soft wheat flour     0.7 Ecus</p>
<p>    Durum grain	    5.0 Ecus</p>
<p>    Durum semolina	 7.5 Ecus</p>
</text>
